# plan

Turn an approved design into a testable task breakdown. Read
`docs/process/workflow.md` (Plan) and `docs/process/journal-state-plans.md`.
{% if modules.speckit %}Run `/speckit-plan` + `/speckit-tasks`; add `tier: N` and `issue: <ref>`
lines to `specs/<feature>/plan.md`; `/speckit-analyze` at plan exit for Tier 3 or a heavily iterated spec
(`docs/process/modules/speckit.md`).
{% else %}The design must be clarification-free: no unresolved `[NEEDS CLARIFICATION]`
marker survives into a plan (the `clarification` gate blocks it).
{% endif %}Required for Tier 2+.
